Update Gentoo repo:			emaint sync -a
Upgrade system:				emerge -uUD @world
Remove package:				emerge -c <pkg>

See USE flags applied to package:	equery uses <pkg>
See package owning file:		equery belongs <path>

See OpenRC services:			rc-status
Start OpenRC service:			rc-service <serv> start
Enable OpenRC service:			rc-update [--user] add <serv> <default|boot|...>
Disable OpenRC service:			rc-update [--user] del <serv> <default|boot|...>

View firewall rules:			nft list ruleset

Reload AutoFS config:			/etc/init.d/autofs reload

Export public key:			gpg --armor --export <id>
